     "crown it with flowers,",
     "for it is a thing of mine.",
     "Ah! Chinita, oh yes!",
     "Ah! Oh give me your love!",
     "Ah! Oh come with me,",
     "chinita, to where I live!"
    ],
    [
     "The day that we marry",
     "God help me!",
     "In the week when we must go [?],",
     "it makes me laugh,",
     "from the church close together,",
     "oh yes, sir,",
     "we will go off to sleep.",
     "There I go."
    ],
    [
     "When the little priest gives us",
